  "note": "Firms whose careers sites can't be enumerated from Node (anti-bot SPAs, unsupported ATS, or own-site listings). An agent/browser renders each URL, reads role text via the selector, and writes snapshots/<key>.json as {\"key\",\"firm\",\"capturedAt\",\"roles\":[{\"title\",\"location\",\"url\"}]}. The v2 scan folds snapshot roles into the report (filtered by the same role rules) and treats a firm with no snapshot as 'could not fully verify'.",
